003e\\n\\u003c/aside\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThey do read the feature requests/bug reports, this even showed them that nobody even wanted that always save to Roblox when trying to create a game, they now start as local files (thank god)\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:14,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:1,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:75,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2023-08-30T04:21:37.679Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:12,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:1,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:6,\&quot;reads\&quot;:869,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:868,\&quot;score\&quot;:293.8,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:2569127,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;the-new-coregui-is-a-downgrade\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\&quot;Werty\&quot;,\&quot;primary_group_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_name\&quot;:\&quot;Builders\&quot;,\&quot;flair_url\&quot;:\&quot;hammer\&quot;,\&quot;flair_bg_color\&quot;:\&quot;E5BF00\&quot;,\&quot;flair_color\&quot;:\&quot;fff\&quot;,\&quot;flair_group_id\&quot;:53,\&quot;badges_granted\&quot;:[],\&quot;version\&quot;:1,\&quot;can_edit\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_delete\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_recover\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_see_hidden_post\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_wiki\&quot;:false,\&quot;read\&quot;:true,\&quot;user_title\&quot;:\&quot;Programmer\&quot;,\&quot;title_is_group\&quot;:false,\&quot;reply_to_user\&quot;:{\&quot;username\&quot;:\&quot;bitsplicer\&quot;,\&quot;name\&quot;:\&quot;bitsplicer\&quot;,\&quot;avatar_template\&quot;:\&quot;/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/bitsplicer/{size}/9071017_2.png\&quot;},\&quot;bookmarked\&quot;:false,\&quot;actions_summary\&quot;:[{\&quot;id\&quot;:2,\&quot;count\&quot;:6}],\&quot;moderator\&quot;:false,\&quot;admin\&quot;:false,\&quot;staff\&quot;:false,\&quot;user_id\&quot;:31748,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;trust_level\&quot;:1,\&quot;deleted_at\&quot;:null,\&quot;user_deleted\&quot;:false,\&quot;edit_reason\&quot;:null,\&quot;can_view_edit_history\&quot;:false,\&quot;wiki\&quot;:false,\&quot;post_url\&quot;:\&quot;/t/the-new-coregui-is-a-downgrade/2569127/14\&quot;,\&quot;can_accept_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_unaccept_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;accepted_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_accepted_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_translate\&quot;:false,\&quot;is_translated\&quot;:false,\&quot;detected_language\&quot;:null},{\&quot;id\&quot;:9567849,\&quot;name\&quot;:\&quot;moo1210\&quot;,\&quot;username\&quot;:\&quot;moo1210\&quot;,\&quot;avatar_template\&quot;:\&quot;/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/moo1210/{size}/8987491_2.png\&quot;,\&quot;created_at\&quot;:\&quot;2023-08-30T10:29:20.614Z\&quot;,\&quot;cooked\&quot;:\&quot;\\u003cp\\u003eThe whole reason it’s in \\u003cem\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBETA\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/em\\u003e is so they can get feedback like this. Constructive feedback on a beta feature is much different than constantly complaining about something on Twitter, you’re providing valuable details to Roblox here. If no one gave any of this feedback and just stayed silent, a lot of these issues would likely not have been addressed or mentioned before being promoted to a live feature, excluding the obvious crashing bugs.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThis is how it works for all companies regardless of size, if they didn’t want external feedback for this feature, \\u003cstrong\\u003ethere would be no beta\\u003c/strong\\u003e.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:15,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:1,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:75,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2023-08-30T10:29:20.614Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:12,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:3,\&quot;reads\&quot;:829,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:828,\&quot;score\&quot;:375.8,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:2569127,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;the-new-coregui-is-a-downgrade\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\&quot;moo1210\&