t=\\\&quot;16\\\&quot; data-topic=\\\&quot;2569127\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;title\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;quote-controls\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cimg alt=\\\&quot;\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;24\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;24\\\&quot; src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/pezsmistic/60/8957111_2.png\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;avatar\\\&quot;\\u003e PeZsmistic:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e(nobody should have been using that space anyway, visibility of that menu was at the mercy of platform updates)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/aside\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eMany top experiences are even currently using this space, it also does not seem like unintended behaviour nor was it flagged by Roblox to be so. This button being required now rejects two corners of the screen from being used rather than the singular corner blocked previously and affects immersion in experiences which now have to cope with two icons permanently visible at all times on a player’s UI.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:19,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:1,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:75,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2023-08-30T17:05:13.232Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:1,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:16,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:1,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:1,\&quot;reads\&quot;:757,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:756,\&quot;score\&quot;:206.4,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:2569127,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;the-new-coregui-is-a-downgrade\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\&quot;Abcreator\&quot;,\&quot;primary_group_name\&quot;:\&quot;Event_Organizers\&quot;,\&quot;flair_name\&quot;:\&quot;Event_Organizers\&quot;,\&quot;flair_url\&quot;:\&quot;//devforum-uploads.s3.dualstack.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/original/4X/5/f/4/5f4ebf02fa9ebe7761c4220916e86e88c724c313.png\&quot;,\&quot;flair_bg_color\&quot;:\&quot